---
import '../styles/site.css';
---
<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"/><title>Photo Atlas Studio</title></head>
<body data-page="admin"><div class="admin-shell">
<header class="site-header glass"><a class="brand" href="/">Photo Atlas<span>STUDIO</span></a><div class="admin-header-actions"><a href="/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">查看网站 ↗</a><button class="icon-button" data-theme-toggle aria-label="切换深浅色">◐</button><button id="logout" class="button subtle" hidden>退出登录</button></div></header>
<section id="login-section" class="login-card glass" hidden><p class="eyebrow">PHOTO ATLAS STUDIO</p><h1>管理你的摄影作品</h1><p>登录后管理照片、相册和图文随笔。</p><form id="login-form"><label>用户名<input name="username" autocomplete="username" required maxlength="80"/></label><label>密码<input name="password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" required maxlength="200"/></label><button class="button primary" type="submit">登录</button><p id="login-error" role="alert"></p></form></section>
<div id="admin-workspace" hidden><nav class="admin-tabs glass" aria-label="后台工作区"><button data-tab="media" class="active">媒体</button><button data-tab="upload">上传照片</button><button data-tab="library">信息整理</button><button data-tab="albums">相册</button><button data-tab="posts">随笔</button><button data-tab="settings">设置</button><button data-tab="archive">回收站</button></nav>
<main>
<section data-panel="media"><div class="section-heading"><div><h1>媒体库</h1><p id="media-summary"></p></div><div class="admin-header-actions"><button id="media-refresh" class="button subtle" type="button">刷新媒体</button><button class="button primary" data-open-upload>上传照片 +</button></div></div><div class="toolbar glass"><input id="media-search" type="search" placeholder="搜索标题或文件名" aria-label="搜索媒体"/><select id="media-filter" aria-label="筛选照片"><option value="all">所有照片</option><option value="published">已发布</option><option value="draft">未发布</option><option value="processing">处理中或失败</option></select><select id="media-album" aria-label="筛选相册"><option value="">所有相册 / 旅程</option></select><select id="media-category" aria-label="筛选作品类别"><option value="">所有题材</option><option>人像</option><option>自然</option><option>城市</option><option>星空</option></select><select id="media-metadata" aria-label="筛选整理状态"><option value="all">所有整理状态</option><option value="located">已知地点</option><option value="location">地点待补充</option><option value="coordinates">坐标待补充</option><option value="date">日期待补充</option><option value="duplicates">相似图待确认</option></select><select id="media-place" aria-label="筛选具体地点"><option value="">所有地点</option></select><button id="select-filtered" class="button subtle">选中筛选结果</button><button id="clear-selected" class="button subtle">清空选择</button><button id="batch-metadata" class="button subtle">批量地点 / 时间</button><span id="selection-count">未选择</span><button id="batch-publish" class="button subtle">发布所选</button><button id="batch-unpublish" class="button subtle">取消发布所选</button></div><details class="glass metadata-history"><summary>地点和时间修改记录</summary><div id="metadata-history"></div></details><div id="media-grid" class="admin-photo-grid"></div></section>
<section data-panel="upload" hidden><div class="section-heading"><div><h1>上传照片</h1><p>原图先保存，再生成展示图。新照片默认未发布。</p></div></div><div class="glass upload-card"><label>上传到相册<select id="upload-album"><option value="">不指定相册</option></select></label><label class="drop-zone" id="drop-zone"><strong>拖入照片，或点击选择文件</strong><span>原片 JPEG / PNG / WebP / TIFF / HEIC · 单张最高 8GiB · 自动跳过重复 · 可断点继续</span><input id="upload-files" type="file" accept=".jpg,.jpeg,.png,.webp,.tif,.tiff,.heic,.heif" multiple/></label><label class="button subtle">选择照片文件夹<input id="upload-folder" type="file" webkitdirectory multiple hidden/></label><div id="upload-queue" aria-live="polite"></div><div class="upload-footer"><p>中断后 7 天内重新选择同一文件，可继续缺失的分块。</p><button class="button subtle" id="refresh-media">查看已上传照片</button></div></div><section id="unfinished-uploads" class="glass unfinished" hidden></section></section>
<section data-panel="library" hidden><div class="section-heading"><div><h1>信息整理</h1><p>自动提取拍摄信息，结合文件名与目录整理地点和时间。缺失信息可整组补充。</p></div><a class="button subtle" href="/footprints/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">查看地图与时间轴 ↗</a></div><div id="library-metrics" class="library-metrics"></div><div class="library-actions"><button id="library-enrich" class="button primary">自动整理全部</button><button id="library-audit" class="button subtle">重新检查重复图</button><button id="library-publish" class="button subtle">查重后发布全部</button></div><p id="library-operation" class="muted" role="status"></p><div class="section-heading"><h2>相似作品比较</h2><p>确切重复图会移入回收站；仅画面相似的作品可以同时保留。</p></div><div id="duplicate-groups"></div></section><section data-panel="albums" hidden><div class="section-heading"><div><h1>相册</h1><p>相册分为旅行、拍摄项目、专题。同一次旅程或项目使用一个相册；年份确定时再加年份，不使用“公共”“假期”等来源目录名。</p></div><button id="new-album" class="button primary">新建相册 +</button></div><div id="admin-album-list" class="album-grid"></div><details><summary>已合并或归档的相册</summary><div id="archived-albums"></div></details></section>
<section data-panel="posts" hidden><div class="section-heading"><div><h1>随笔</h1><p>撰写图文内容，草稿不会出现在公开网站。</p></div><button id="new-post" class="button primary">写随笔 +</button></div><div id="admin-post-list" class="post-grid"></div></section>
<section data-panel="settings" hidden><div class="section-heading"><h1>网站设置</h1></div><form id="settings-form" class="glass editor-form"><label>网站名称<input name="site_name" maxlength="80" required/></label><label>首页标题<input name="subtitle" maxlength="200" required/></label><label>首页说明<textarea name="description" maxlength="600" rows="2"></textarea></label><label>关于我<textarea name="about" maxlength="10000" rows="7"></textarea></label><label>联系方式<input name="contact" maxlength="300"/></label><label>版权文字<input name="copyright" maxlength="200"/></label><button class="button primary" type="submit">保存设置</button></form></section>
<section data-panel="archive" hidden><div class="section-heading"><div><h1>回收站</h1><p>移入回收站会停止公开展示，原图仍保留；恢复后默认为未发布。</p></div></div><div id="archive-list" class="admin-photo-grid"></div></section>
</main></div></div>
<div id="notice" class="notice" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></div>
<dialog id="photo-editor" class="editor-dialog"><form id="photo-form"><div class="dialog-heading"><h2>编辑照片</h2><button type="button" data-close-dialog aria-label="关闭编辑">×</button></div><img id="edit-photo-preview" alt="照片预览"/><input name="id" type="hidden"/><label>标题<input name="title" maxlength="240" required/></label><label>说明<textarea name="caption" rows="3" maxlength="5000"></textarea></label><label>替代文字<input name="alt" maxlength="300"/></label><label>作品分类<select name="category"><option value="">未分类</option><option>人像</option><option>自然</option><option>城市</option><option>星空</option></select></label><label>标签（逗号分隔）<input name="tags"/></label><label>相册（可多选）<select name="album_ids" id="edit-photo-albums" multiple></select></label><label>排序<input name="position" type="number" min="-100000" max="100000"/></label><div class="check-row"><label><input name="published" type="checkbox"/>公开展示</label><label><input name="featured" type="checkbox"/>精选作品</label></div><p id="edit-photo-info"></p><div id="similar-photos"></div><button id="confirm-distinct" type="button" class="button subtle">已比较，确认是不同作品</button><p id="edit-photo-metadata" class="muted"></p><button id="edit-metadata" type="button" class="button subtle">修改地点和日期</button><div class="dialog-actions"><a id="download-original" class="button subtle">下载原图</a><button id="retry-photo" type="button" class="button subtle">重试处理</button><button id="archive-photo" type="button" class="button danger">移入回收站</button><button class="button primary" type="submit">保存</button></div></form></dialog>
<dialog id="metadata-editor" class="editor-dialog"><form id="metadata-form"><div class="dialog-heading"><h2>批量地点和时间</h2><button type="button" data-close-dialog aria-label="关闭地点时间编辑">×</button></div><p id="metadata-selection"></p><div id="metadata-preview" class="metadata-preview"></div><label class="check-label"><input name="overwrite_place" type="checkbox"/>覆盖已有地点（默认保护已填写的地点）</label><label>地点<input name="place" maxlength="120" placeholder="例如：东京、上海、祈年殿"/></label><label>拍摄日期<input name="date" maxlength="32" placeholder="支持2024、2024-04、2024-04-12"/></label><div class="metadata-form-row"><label>纬度（可选）<input name="latitude" type="number" step="any" min="-90" max="90"/></label><label>经度（可选）<input name="longitude" type="number" step="any" min="-180" max="180"/></label></div><p class="muted">留空的字段保持现状。地点名称可直接保存；没有可靠坐标时保留名称，不在地图上猜测落点。手动修改后会保护该字段。<span id="metadata-save-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></span></p><div class="dialog-actions"><button id="metadata-reset" type="button" class="button subtle">恢复自动整理</button><button class="button primary" type="submit">保存所选照片</button></div></form></dialog><dialog id="album-editor" class="editor-dialog"><form id="album-form"><div class="dialog-heading"><h2>编辑相册</h2><button type="button" data-close-dialog aria-label="关闭编辑">×</button></div><input name="id" type="hidden"/><label>类型<select name="kind"><option value="travel">旅行</option><option value="project">拍摄项目</option><option value="series">专题</option></select></label><label>名称<input name="title" required maxlength="120" placeholder="例如：云南旅行、紫衣海岸、黑白影像"/></label><p class="muted">旅行：地点 + 旅行（确定年份时可加年份）。项目：具体拍摄名称。专题：统一主题。作品类别与颜色使用筛选或标签。</p><label>说明<textarea name="description" rows="4" maxlength="3000"></textarea></label><label>封面<select name="cover_id" id="album-cover"></select></label><label>排序<input name="position" type="number" value="0" min="-100000" max="100000"/></label><label class="check-label"><input name="published" type="checkbox"/>公开相册</label><div class="dialog-actions"><button id="delete-album" class="button danger" type="button">归档相册</button><button class="button primary" type="submit">保存相册</button></div><div class="dialog-actions"><label>合并到<select id="merge-album-target"></select></label><button id="merge-album" class="button subtle" type="button">合并并保留全部照片</button></div></form></dialog>
<dialog id="post-editor" class="editor-dialog wide-dialog"><form id="post-form"><div class="dialog-heading"><h2>编辑随笔</h2><button type="button" data-close-dialog aria-label="关闭编辑">×</button></div><input name="id" type="hidden"/><label>标题<input name="title" required maxlength="240"/></label><label>摘要<textarea name="excerpt" rows="2" maxlength="600"></textarea></label><div class="markdown-tools"><select id="post-photo-picker" aria-label="选择要插入的照片"></select><button id="insert-post-photo" type="button" class="button subtle">插入照片</button></div><label>正文（Markdown）<textarea name="body" rows="14" maxlength="60000" class="markdown-input" placeholder="写下拍摄时的记录。&#10;&#10;支持标题、段落、列表和照片。"></textarea></label><label class="check-label"><input name="published" type="checkbox"/>发布随笔</label><div class="dialog-actions"><button id="unpublish-post" class="button danger" type="button">取消发布</button><button class="button primary" type="submit">保存随笔</button></div></form></dialog>
<script>import '../scripts/admin';</script>
</body></html>